Package: ephemeris
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Steffen Galan <steffen.galan@gmail.com>
Depends: libxkbcommon0, libwayland-client0
Description: Ephemeris — e-ink planner and note-taking app
 Ephemeris is a planner and note-taking application focused on e-ink
 devices with pens (e.g. PineNote). It manages profiles, calendars,
 tasks, and handwritten notes.
Homepage: https://github.com/steffen030/ephemeris
